### Obtener avisos de mantenimiento programados por odómetro (sin filtros) — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/scheduledNoticesByOdometer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Con filtros de operador/organización/división/subdivisión — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/scheduledNoticesByOdometer?operatorId=1&organizationId=1&divisionId=1&subdivisionId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sin token → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/scheduledNoticesByOdometer

### Filtro con tipo inválido (divisionId no numérico) → 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/scheduledNoticesByOdometer?divisionId=abc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
